name: Bug report
description: Something is not working as expected: crashes, incorrect results, etc.
title: "Bug: <Add a short description>"
labels: ["triage"]
body:
  - type: markdown
    attributes:
      value: |
        Before submitting your issue, please make sure to check previous issues and the project's [documentation](../../docs)

  - type: textarea
    id: description
    attributes:
      label: Description
      description: |
        Describe the bug in as much detail as possible. Let us know:
        - What you were trying to do
        - What you expected to happen
        - What actually happened.
        Include any relevant error messages, logs, screenshots, or other context that may help.
    validations:
      required: true

  - type: textarea
    id: steps-to-reproduce
    attributes:
      label: Steps to Reproduce
      description: |
        Provide the smallest set of steps needed to reproduce the issue.
        Leave this field blank for feature requests, questions, or other issue types.
      placeholder: |
        1. ...
        2. ...
        3. ...
      
  - type: textarea
    id: code-snippet
    attributes:
      label: Code Snippet
      description: Add any relevant code snippets here (if applicable).
      render: cpp
      placeholder: // Your code here

  - type: input
    id: harmonyy-version
    attributes:
      label: Harmonyy Version (Commit ID)
      placeholder: e.g., v1.2.3 or 7a3b5c1
    validations:
      required: true

  - type: input
    id: os
    attributes:
      label: Operating System
      placeholder: e.g., Ubuntu 22.04, Windows 11

  - type: input
    id: dependencies
    attributes:
      label: Dependencies
      placeholder: Versions of Eigen, Symengine, and Casadi

  - type: textarea
    id: solution-workaround
    attributes:
      label: Suggested Solution or Workaround
      description: If you have any ideas for how to fix this issue or have found a workaround, please share them here.

  - type: checkboxes
    id: checklist
    attributes:
      label: Checklist
      options:
        - label: I have checked the documentation and existing issues.
          required: true
        - label: I have provided all required details and steps to reproduce (if applicable).
          required: true
        - label: I have added screenshots/code snippets where appropriate.
          required: false
        - label: I am willing to submit a PR for this issue (if applicable).
          required: false

  - type: markdown
    attributes:
      value: |
        ---
        Thank you for contributing! We’ll review your issue as soon as possible.
